      "type": "rich-text",
      "id": "content",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Schools nationwide are invited to enter Prathom 5-6 (Grade 5-6) students in the Youth Thai Language Skills Competition 2022 (reading aloud skills) via Zoom Cloud Meetings",
        "Compete for scholarships and Royal Society of Thailand honorary awards",
        "100 places available; applications open now until Monday 31 January 2022 (applications will close as soon as 100 applicants are reached, even before the closing date)",
        "Application link",
        "https://forms.gle/9EjEXa1rDAHUUNFd9",
        "The qualifying round will be held on Saturday 12 February 2022 and the final round on Saturday 26 February 2022",
        "Details are in the attached announcement"
      ]
